      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "01_shang_n1.mp3",
      "bytes": 134207,
      "heard": "關鍵年前,商朝的占卜師把一個問題刻在歸家上。放軍活禮考。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 8.32
    },
    {
      "name": "01_shang_q",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "[whispers] 其自东来雨？",
